{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "55", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "So that is it from this game! 56.5 overs is what we witnessed. A sad end to what was a good series. However, both the sides now turn their attention to the longest format as they head into a three-match Test series. The first one begins on the 16th of November in Abu Dhabi at 1000 local (0600 GMT). Till then, goodbye and take care!", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T18:28:46+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "54", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Pakistan skipper, Sarfraz Ahmed, says they have had a good series overall. Admits they were poor in the first game but came back well in the second. He reckons they were favorites to win here. Further adds that they tried a different combination with the batting line-up as they played an extra batsman. States Afridi is a very promising youngster but he still has a lot to learn. Ends by saying New Zealand always look to dig in and take the game till the end.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T18:26:30+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "53", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "New Zealand skipper, Tom Latham, says they did not expect it to finish this way but it was an exciting series. Mentions they have done well to not only adapt here but in various parts of the world. Credits the way Ferguson bowled today. Ends by saying, adapting to the surfaces in the longest format will be the biggest challenge.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T18:25:03+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "52", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Man of the Series, Shaheen Afridi, says he is very happy with his achievement. Adds further that he too is trying to learn day-by-day. States he looks to land it in the right areas with the new ball. Ends by saying he will try to do good in the longest format also.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T18:24:07+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "51", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Man of the Match, Lockie Ferguson, says the pitch was a touch slower and he had to adjust. Mentions he is happy with the way they performed with the ball but is disappointing they could not get a whole game. Informs he tried changing things up in the middle and he got success. States pace is his strength but he does look to change the pace, especially on such wickets. Admits the cross-seam deliveries helps on such surfaces. Ends by saying he is trying to improve everyday and he is pleased to be a part of such a good team.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T18:23:11+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "50", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Around 7 overs is what we managed in the second innings. New Zealand lost Munro early to Afridi but then Nicholls and Worker did try and steady the ship. They were going well before the rain arrived. Earlier in the day, a solid batting performance saw Pakistan post a total which was above par. Babar Azam was their star with a 92 but he was well supported by Haris Sohail and Zaman. They looked like they would get a lot more but Ferguson's fifer, kept them under 300. Stay tuned for a while.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T18:05:52+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "49", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Bad news folks! The inevitable has happened, the game has been CALLED OFF. Yes, you read it right, a game being called off due to rain in the UAE. There was a chat between the umpires and the skippers and that was that. Customary handshakes taking place at the moment. The series ends 1-1.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T18:03:38+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Update - 1000 local (1800 GMT) - The rain did stop for a while but it is back again. The cut off time for a T20 game is 1020 local. Chances of a game look bleak now.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T18:00:06+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "It has started to drizzle here and the umpires have asked the players to walk off. So rain has stopped play in the UAE. Not something which happens a lot here. We though can expect this one to be a short delay.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:48:15+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.5", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "1,10,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "FOUR! Easy-peasy! Short and on the body, Nicholls helps it on its way through backward square leg for a boundary.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:47:04+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.4", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "6,249,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Fuller in length on off, HN strokes it to mid off. The fielder misfields and a run is taken.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:46:35+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.3", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "8,354,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Almost played it on! This was shortin length around off, Nicholls tries to keep it out off the back foot but away from his body. It goes off the inner half towards square leg for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:45:23+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.2", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "A little too straight, Nicholls misses the flick and is hit on the pads.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:44:48+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "6.1", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Excellent fielding! Full and on the pads, Nicholls flicks it towards mid-wicket. Haris Sohail there dives to his right and saves a boundary.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:44:30+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.6", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Keeps it on the off stump, it is defended onto the ground.", "Summary": {"Score": "29/1", "Over": "6", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4351", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "17", "Balls": "18", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "57594", "Runs": "10", "Balls": "16", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "64321", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "17", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:43:04+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.5", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Good comeback! Gets his line right and lands it around off, gets it to jag back in. Worker tries to flick but misses to get hit near the box.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:42:15+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.4", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "2,72,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "FOUR! Consecutive boundaries! Last one was power so this one was finesse. On the pads, it is worked fine down the leg side.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:41:38+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.3", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": "8,341,5", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "FOUR! First boundary of this innings! He did not lose his shape this time as he pulls it through mid-wicket for a boundary. That made a cracking sound of the bat.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:40:59+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.2", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Where did that come from? Worker dances down the track and tries to go big. He loses his shape and to his fortune gets beaten.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:40:14+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,296,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Back of a length on middle, Henry pushes it to mid on for a single.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:39:31+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.6", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Full and around off, the batsman times it to covers. Another tight over comes to an end.", "Summary": {"Score": "20/1", "Over": "5", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4351", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "9", "Balls": "13", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "57594", "Runs": "9", "Balls": "15", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "66833", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:38:25+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.5", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Good length and on off, Worker gets right behind the line of the delivery and defends it out.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:37:45+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.4", "Id": "33", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "5,189,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "The batsman has defended it by getting right behind the line of the delivery. The batsmen have run through for a single.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:37:11+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.3", "Id": "32", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "8,346,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Goes for the yorker but Worker gets his bat down in time and hits it through mid-wicket. A couple taken.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:36:32+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.2", "Id": "31", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "3,114,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Nicely played! This is guided down to third man for a single.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:36:01+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.1", "Id": "30", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "On the stumps, blocked.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:35:24+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.6", "Id": "29", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,279,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Chance but the fielder fails to collect the ball! Ashraf comes around around the wicket and lands it around off, it is pushed towards mid on. The batsmen go for a run and the fielder makes it easier for them by not collecting it. A couple of this over.", "Summary": {"Score": "16/1", "Over": "4", "Runs": "3", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "4351", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "8", "Balls": "9", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "57594", "Runs": "6", "Balls": "13", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "64321", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:34:26+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.5", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "6,268,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "On the fuller side, Henry strokes it to mid off and a run is taken.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:33:35+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "4th dot! Once again attacks the off pole and lands it around off, the batsman blocks it out.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:33:02+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.3", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Back of a length on off, HN defends it off the back foot.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:32:14+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.2", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "3,119,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "On the shorter side and outside off, the batter guides it down to third man for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:31:32+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.1", "Id": "24", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "On a length and around off, defended.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:31:04+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "23", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Fuller on off, Nicholls strokes it to covers.", "Summary": {"Score": "13/1", "Over": "3", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "57594", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "5", "Balls": "10", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "4351", "Runs": "6", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "66833", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "8", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:30:06+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.5", "Id": "22", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "3", "ZAD": "6,268,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Good shot! It is a push down the ground past the bowler. Hasan Ali from mid on gives it a chase. He slides and tries to throw it to the fielder running in from mid off. He though throws it away from him and the batsmen take three.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:29:38+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.4", "Id": "21", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Good length on off, the batsman keeps it out.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:28:47+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.3", "Id": "20", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "7,291,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Good length and angling into the batter, Henry works it towards mid-wicket. The batsmen complete one run. Malik fails to collect the ball and Worker wants another but is sent back.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:28:23+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.2", "Id": "19", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Good length around off, it is stroked to mid off.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:27:43+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.1", "Id": "18", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "3,128,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Outside off, it is guided down to third man for a single.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:27:13+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.6", "Id": "17", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "5,197,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Back of a length on off, HN punches it through covers for another couple.", "Summary": {"Score": "8/1", "Over": "2", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "57594", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "4", "Balls": "7", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "4351", "Runs": "2", "Balls": "3", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "64321", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:26:23+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.5", "Id": "16", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": "1,18,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "On the shorter side, Nicholls pulls it down to fine leg for a couple. Gets off the mark with that brace.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:25:37+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.4", "Id": "15", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Good shot! On a length and around off, the batsman punches it towards covers.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:24:57+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.3", "Id": "14", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Attacks the length again around off, Henry lunges and blocks it out.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:24:17+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.2", "Id": "13", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "57594", "Commentary": "Good length on off, Henry blocks it out.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:23:45+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.1", "Id": "12", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "2,71,4", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "64321", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "On the shorter side, it is tucked to mid-wicket for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:23:23+00:0