true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "11724", "Commentary": "OUT! KABOOM! There goes Colin Munro and it is Shaheen Afridi who gets him out once again. What a delivery this is. He lands it on a length and around off, jags back in after pitching. Munro tries to drive but the ball sneaks through the gap between bat and pad and hits the top of middle. Munro walks back cheaply. Body blow for the Kiwis. They needed Munro to step up especially in the absence of Williamson. Pakistan are ecstatic as they know this is a huge wicket. Ideal start for them.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "11724", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:19:53+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.3", "Id": "6", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "11724", "Commentary": "Fuller in length on middle, Munro drives it back to the bowler.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:19:16+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.2", "Id": "5", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "1,14,2", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Loose shot there! Just ahead of a length around off, it comes back in a little. Worker plays a drive away from his body but gets an inside edge towards short fine leg for a run.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:18:53+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.2", "Id": "4", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Another wide! Down the leg side and it has been wided.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:18:31+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.1", "Id": "3", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "Good length again and it is just outside off, Worker makes a leave.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:17:58+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.1", "Id": "2", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "66833", "Batsman": "4351", "Commentary": "A false start! Wide and outside off, the umpire stretches his hands side ways.", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:17:37+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "1", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "We are back for the chase! The Kiwi openers, Colin Munro and George Worker make their way out to the middle. Shaheen Afridi has the first new ball in hand. Here we go...", "Timestamp": "2018-11-11T15:13:33+00:00", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "Deleted_UID": null}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 55, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:15:09 AM"}}}